OL,3,GNEWSA'Tenants left my property in a
OL,4,Ashocking state'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landlord has described how she was
OL,7,Fforced to live with family and in a
OL,8,Fcamper van for months as she could not
OL,9,Fget a tenant to leave her property.
OL,11,FVictoria Mountain, who got her Surrey
OL,12,Fhome back after allegedly not receiving
OL,13,Frent for 10 months, said she cleared 15
OL,14,Fbags of rubbish in a day because it was
OL,15,Fso messy.
OL,17,F"When I first came in here, it was just
OL,18,Fsuch a shock. I was in tears," the
OL,19,Fmother-of-two said.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
