OL,3,GNEWSA'Tenants left my property in a
OL,4,Ashocking state'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Housing, Communities
OL,7,Fand Local Government (MHCLG) said the
OL,8,FRenters' Right Act ensured landlords
OL,9,Fhad "robust grounds for possession if
OL,10,Fthere is good reason to take it back,
OL,11,Fincluding a tenant damaging the
OL,12,Fproperty or falling into rent arrears".
